{"Title":"An Act relative to notification of alcohol by volume in beers to be consumed on the premises","BillNumber":"H304","DocketNumber":"HD1339","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T15:09:20.373"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T15:09:20.3733333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H304/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garry of Dracut, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 304) of Colleen M. Garry relative to notification of alcohol by volume in beers to be consumed on the premises.  Consumer Protection and Professional Licensure.","DocumentText":"\tAmend Chapter 138 by adding the following at the end thereof:\r\n\tSection 79. All licensees for alcoholic beverages to be drunk on the premises shall list the alcohol by volume for each beer selection on their menu.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J17","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J17"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}